---
{
  "name": "Omnissa Access Connector 26.05 — Network Topology",
  "notes": "<p><em>As of July 2026 — sizing and platform requirements are relatively static; verify against current Omnissa documentation before deployment. Source: <a href=\"https://docs.omnissa.com/bundle/ws1_access_connector_installV26.05/page/WorkspaceONEAccessConnectorSystemsRequirements.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Omnissa Access Connector 26.05 Systems Requirements</a> (docs.omnissa.com, checked 2026-07-10).</em></p><h4>Configuration Notes</h4><ul>{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"custom\")}}<li><b>Custom Sizing:</b> {{customVCPU}} vCPU, {{customRAM}} GB RAM, {{customDisk}} GB Disk Space</li>{{/if}}<li><b>Processor Requirement:</b> Intel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E5-2650 0@2.00 GHz (2 processors) x64 bit or higher</li>{{#if enableDirSync}}{{#if (eq dirSyncMethod \"iwa\")}}<li><b>Directory Integration:</b> AD over IWA (domain-joined connector)</li>{{/if}}{{#if (eq dirSyncMethod \"ad-ldap\")}}<li><b>Directory Integration:</b> AD over LDAP (bind account)</li>{{/if}}{{#if (eq dirSyncMethod \"ldap\")}}<li><b>Directory Integration:</b> LDAP Directory</li>{{/if}}<li><b>Directory Sync Java Heap:</b> {{#if (eq deploymentSize \"custom\")}}Adjust as needed{{else}}{{#if (gt (countTrue enableDirSync enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth enableVirtualApp) 1)}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"small\")}}<code>xmx=4g</code>{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"medium\")}}<code>xmx=8g</code>{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"large\")}}<code>xmx=12g</code>{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"small\")}}<code>xmx=4g</code>{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"medium\")}}<code>xmx=4g</code>{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"large\")}}<code>xmx=8g</code>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}</li>{{/if}}{{#if enableUserAuth}}<li><b>User Auth Java Heap:</b> <code>xmx=1g</code></li>{{/if}}{{#if enableKerberosAuth}}<li><b>Kerberos Auth Java Heap:</b> <code>xmx=1g</code></li>{{/if}}{{#if enableVirtualApp}}<li><b>Virtual App Java Heap:</b> {{#if (gt (countTrue enableDirSync enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth enableVirtualApp) 1)}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"small\")}}<code>xmx=1g</code>{{/if}}{{#if (or (eq deploymentSize \"medium\") (eq deploymentSize \"large\"))}}<code>xmx=2g</code>{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize \"custom\")}}Adjust as needed{{/if}}{{else}}<code>xmx=1g</code>{{/if}}</li>{{/if}}<li>Memory requirements include the OS and Omnissa Access connector components. Adjust if running other applications.</li><li>By default: Directory Sync <code>xmx=4g</code>, User Auth <code>xmx=1g</code>, Kerberos Auth <code>xmx=1g</code>, Virtual App <code>xmx=1g</code>.</li><li>Deployments with large or nested groups require more memory.</li>{{#if enableVirtualApp}}{{#if enableCitrix}}<li>For Citrix integrations, a maximum of 630 user or group entitlements is supported per resource.</li>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if (or enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth)}}<li>User Auth and Kerberos Auth nodes are not vertically scalable. For better throughput, add more nodes.</li>{{/if}}</ul><h4>Network Notes</h4><ul><li><b>Access Service Connection:</b> The outbound 443 connection from the connector to the Omnissa Access service must remain open at all times; intermediate proxies or connection-management devices must not terminate it.</li>{{#if enableDirSync}}{{#if (eq dirSyncMethod \"ldap\")}}<li><b>Generic LDAP Directory:</b> Global Catalog ports (3268/3269) and the domain-controller ports (88, 135, 445, 464) are Active Directory constructs and do not apply to generic LDAP directories, so they are omitted.</li>{{else}}<li><b>Directory Port Attribution</b> (per the 26.05 Systems Requirements): 389/636/3268/3269 belong to the Directory Sync service, and also to the User Auth service when password authentication is used; 88, 135, and 445 belong to Directory Sync; 464 belongs to Directory Sync + User Auth (password-change flows). The 445 flow shown targets the domain controller per the 26.05 table; the separate ThinApp file-server 445 flow is not modeled.</li>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if enableKerberosAuth}}<li><b>Kerberos Auth Service:</b> Its only distinguishing network requirement is inbound 443 from browsers — it has no outbound domain-controller ports. For high availability, place a load balancer in front of the connectors.</li>{{/if}}{{#if enableRSA}}<li><b>RSA SecurID:</b> Port 5555 is the modern REST-API-era default per the 26.05 Systems Requirements (configurable); 22.09-era rows on ports.omnissa.com (checked 2026-07-10) list the legacy agent-protocol value 5500 UDP.</li>{{/if}}{{#if enableVirtualApp}}{{#if enableHorizon}}<li><b>Horizon Integration:</b> ports.omnissa.com (Omnissa Access entry, 22.09-era row, checked 2026-07-10) lists 389 TCP in addition to 443 for connector → Horizon Connection Server; the 26.05 Systems Requirements table lists only 443. Flagged per the union rule — verify before restricting this flow to 443 only.</li>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if (not isCloud)}}<li><b>On-Premises Appliance:</b> The Omnissa Access virtual appliance line remains 24.12.1.0 (plus patches); 26.05 refers to the connector.</li>{{/if}}</ul>",
  "parameters": [
    { "key": "connectorName", "type": "string", "label": "Connector Hostname", "defaultValue": "myconnector.example.com" },
    { "key": "connectorIP", "type": "string", "label": "Connector Static IP", "defaultValue": "10.28.128.3" },
    { "key": "deploymentSize", "type": "select", "label": "Deployment Sizing", "defaultValue": "small", "options": [
      { "label": "Small", "value": "small" },
      { "label": "Medium", "value": "medium" },
      { "label": "Large", "value": "large" },
      { "label": "Custom", "value": "custom" }
    ] },
    { "key": "customVCPU", "type": "number", "label": "vCPU", "defaultValue": 4, "validation": { "min": 1 }, "showWhen": { "key": "deploymentSize", "value": "custom" } },
    { "key": "customRAM", "type": "number", "label": "RAM (GB)", "defaultValue": 8, "validation": { "min": 1 }, "showWhen": { "key": "deploymentSize", "value": "custom" } },
    { "key": "customDisk", "type": "number", "label": "Disk Space (GB)", "defaultValue": 50, "validation": { "min": 10 }, "showWhen": { "key": "deploymentSize", "value": "custom" } },
    { "key": "additionalComments", "type": "string", "label": "Additional Node Comments", "defaultValue": ""},
    { "key": "isCloud", "type": "boolean", "label": "Cloud Deployment", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "accessServiceHost", "type": "string", "label": "Access Service Host", "defaultValue": "access.example.com" },
    { "key": "enableDirSync", "type": "boolean", "label": "Directory Sync Service", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "dirSyncMethod", "type": "select", "label": "Directory Integration Method", "defaultValue": "iwa", "options": [
      { "label": "AD over LDAP", "value": "ad-ldap" },
      { "label": "AD over IWA", "value": "iwa" },
      { "label": "LDAP Directory", "value": "ldap" }
    ], "showWhen": { "key": "enableDirSync", "value": true } },
    { "key": "enableUserAuth", "type": "boolean", "label": "User Auth Service", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "enableKerberosAuth", "type": "boolean", "label": "Kerberos Auth Service", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "enableVirtualApp", "type": "boolean", "label": "Virtual App Service", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "enableHorizon", "type": "boolean", "label": "Horizon Integration", "defaultValue": true, "showWhen": { "key": "enableVirtualApp", "value": true } },
    { "key": "enableCitrix", "type": "boolean", "label": "Citrix Integration", "defaultValue": false, "showWhen": { "key": "enableVirtualApp", "value": true } },
    { "key": "citrixSFPort", "type": "number", "label": "Citrix StoreFront Port", "defaultValue": 443, "validation": { "min": 1, "max": 65535 }, "showWhen": { "key": "enableCitrix", "value": true } },
    { "key": "enableKerberosLB", "type": "boolean", "label": "Load Balancer for Kerberos HA", "defaultValue": false },
    { "key": "lbName", "type": "string", "label": "Load Balancer Label", "defaultValue": "Load Balancer", "showWhen": { "key": "enableKerberosLB", "value": true } },
    { "key": "enableProxy", "type": "boolean", "label": "Outbound HTTP Proxy", "defaultValue": false },
    { "key": "enableRSA", "type": "boolean", "label": "RSA SecurID", "defaultValue": false },
    { "key": "rsaPort", "type": "number", "label": "RSA SecurID Port", "defaultValue": 5555, "validation": { "min": 1, "max": 65535 }, "showWhen": { "key": "enableRSA", "value": true } },
    { "key": "enableSyslog", "type": "boolean", "label": "Syslog Server", "defaultValue": false },
    { "key": "syslogPort", "type": "number", "label": "Syslog UDP Port", "defaultValue": 514, "validation": { "min": 1, "max": 65535 }, "showWhen": { "key": "enableSyslog", "value": true } },
    { "key": "enableNTP", "type": "boolean", "label": "Show NTP Server", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "includeFooterInChart", "type": "boolean", "label": "Include Footer Notes in Chart", "defaultValue": false }
  ]
}
---
graph TD
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  CONNECTOR NODE
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    CONN[<b>Omnissa Access Connector 26.05</b><br/>{{connectorName}} — {{connectorIP}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "custom")}}<br/>{{customVCPU}} vCPU, {{customRAM}} GB RAM, {{customDisk}} GB Disk{{else}}{{#if (gt (countTrue enableDirSync enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth enableVirtualApp) 0)}}<br/>{{#if (gt (countTrue enableDirSync enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth enableVirtualApp) 1)}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "small")}}4 vCPU, 12 GB RAM, 50 GB Disk{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "medium")}}8 vCPU, 16 GB RAM, 50 GB Disk{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "large")}}12 vCPU, 32 GB RAM, 80 GB Disk{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if enableDirSync}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "small")}}2 vCPU, 8 GB RAM, 40 GB Disk{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "medium")}}4 vCPU, 8 GB RAM, 40 GB Disk{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "large")}}8 vCPU, 12 GB RAM, 40 GB Disk{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if (and enableUserAuth (not enableDirSync))}}2 vCPU, 4 GB RAM, 40 GB Disk{{/if}}{{#if (and enableKerberosAuth (and (not enableDirSync) (not enableUserAuth)))}}2 vCPU, 4 GB RAM, 40 GB Disk{{/if}}{{#if (and enableVirtualApp (and (not enableDirSync) (and (not enableUserAuth) (not enableKerberosAuth))))}}2 vCPU, 4 GB RAM, 40 GB Disk{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}<br/>TLS 1.2 + 1.3{{#if additionalComments}}<br/><i>{{additionalComments}}</i>{{/if}}]

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  INBOUND — Kerberos Authentication
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if enableKerberosAuth}}
    BROWSERS[🌐 Browsers / End Users]
    {{#if enableKerberosLB}}
    LB{⚖️ {{lbName}} }
    BROWSERS -->|443 HTTPS| LB
    LB -->|443 HTTPS| CONN
    {{else}}
    BROWSERS -->|443 HTTPS Inbound| CONN
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  OUTBOUND — Omnissa Access Service
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if isCloud}}
    ACCESS[☁️ Omnissa Access Cloud<br/>{{accessServiceHost}}<br/>IPs per KB 68035]
    {{else}}
    ACCESS[🏢 Omnissa Access On-Prem<br/>{{accessServiceHost}}]
    {{/if}}
    {{#if enableProxy}}
    PROXY[🔀 HTTP Proxy<br/>Unauthenticated HTTP/HTTPS<br/>or Authenticated HTTPS]
    CONN -->|Outbound Internet| PROXY
    PROXY -->|443 HTTPS| ACCESS
    {{else}}
    CONN -->|443 HTTPS<br/>All Services| ACCESS
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  OUTBOUND — Identity Infrastructure
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    subgraph IDENTITY[Identity Infrastructure]
        DNS[🔍 DNS Server]
        {{#if enableDirSync}}
        {{#if (eq dirSyncMethod "ldap")}}
        AD[📂 LDAP Directory Server]
        {{else}}
        AD[📂 Active Directory]
        DC[🖥️ Domain Controller]
        {{/if}}
        {{/if}}
    end

    CONN -->|53 TCP/UDP<br/>All Services| DNS

    {{#if enableDirSync}}
    {{#if (eq dirSyncMethod "ldap")}}
    CONN -->|389, 636<br/>Dir Sync{{#if enableUserAuth}} + User Auth{{/if}}| AD
    {{else}}
    CONN -->|389, 636, 3268, 3269<br/>Dir Sync{{#if enableUserAuth}} + User Auth{{/if}}| AD
    CONN -->|88, 135, 445 TCP/UDP<br/>Dir Sync| DC
    CONN -->|464 TCP/UDP<br/>Dir Sync{{#if enableUserAuth}} + User Auth{{/if}}| DC
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  OUTBOUND — RSA SecurID
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if enableUserAuth}}
    {{#if enableRSA}}
    RSA[🔐 RSA SecurID Server]
    CONN -->|{{rsaPort}}<br/>User Auth| RSA
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  OUTBOUND — App Integrations
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if enableVirtualApp}}
    {{#if enableHorizon}}
    subgraph HORIZON_GRP[Horizon Integration]
        HCS[🖥️ Horizon Connection Server]
    end
    CONN -->|443<br/>Virtual App| HCS
    {{/if}}
    {{#if enableCitrix}}
    subgraph CITRIX_GRP[Citrix Integration]
        CSF[🟦 Citrix StoreFront]
        CXA[🟦 Citrix XenApp / XenDesktop]
    end
    CONN -->|{{citrixSFPort}}<br/>Virtual App| CSF
    CONN -->|443<br/>Virtual App| CXA
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
    %% NOTE: Browsers also need direct access to Client Access
    %% FQDNs for Horizon/Citrix collections on their configured
    %% ports. That path does not traverse the connector.

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  OUTBOUND — Monitoring / Infrastructure
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if enableSyslog}}
    SYSLOG[📝 Syslog Server<br/>App-level events only]
    CONN -->|{{syslogPort}} UDP<br/>All Services| SYSLOG
    {{/if}}
    {{#if enableNTP}}
    NTP[🕐 NTP Server]
    CONN -.->|123 UDP<br/>Time Sync| NTP
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  FOOTER NOTES (in-diagram)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if includeFooterInChart}}
    CONN ~~~ NOTES
    NOTES[<b>Configuration Notes</b><br/>As of July 2026<br/>Processor: Intel Xeon E5-2650 or higher<br/>{{#if enableDirSync}}Dir Sync Heap: {{#if (eq deploymentSize "custom")}}adjust as needed{{else}}{{#if (gt (countTrue enableDirSync enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth enableVirtualApp) 1)}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "small")}}xmx=4g{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "medium")}}xmx=8g{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "large")}}xmx=12g{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "small")}}xmx=4g{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "medium")}}xmx=4g{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "large")}}xmx=8g{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}<br/>{{/if}}{{#if enableUserAuth}}User Auth Heap: xmx=1g<br/>{{/if}}{{#if enableKerberosAuth}}Kerberos Auth Heap: xmx=1g<br/>{{/if}}{{#if enableVirtualApp}}Virtual App Heap: {{#if (gt (countTrue enableDirSync enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth enableVirtualApp) 1)}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "small")}}xmx=1g{{/if}}{{#if (or (eq deploymentSize "medium") (eq deploymentSize "large"))}}xmx=2g{{/if}}{{#if (eq deploymentSize "custom")}}adjust as needed{{/if}}{{else}}xmx=1g{{/if}}<br/>{{/if}}Memory includes OS + connector components<br/>{{#if (or enableUserAuth enableKerberosAuth)}}Auth nodes not vertically scalable — add more nodes for throughput<br/>{{/if}}Large or nested groups require more memory<br/>{{#if enableVirtualApp}}{{#if enableCitrix}}Citrix: max 630 user or group entitlements per resource<br/>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if enableVirtualApp}}{{#if enableHorizon}}Horizon CS: 22.09-era ports DB row also lists 389 TCP for this flow<br/>{{/if}}{{/if}}Outbound 443 to Access service must remain open — proxies must not terminate it]
    style NOTES fill:#263238,color:#cfd8dc,stroke:#455a64,stroke-width:1px
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  STYLES
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    style CONN fill:#1565c0,color:#fff,stroke:#0d47a1,stroke-width:2px
    style IDENTITY fill:#f3e5f5,color:#000,stroke:#7b1fa2
    {{#if isCloud}}
    style ACCESS fill:#e8f5e9,color:#1b5e20,stroke:#2e7d32
    {{else}}
    style ACCESS fill:#e3f2fd,color:#0d47a1,stroke:#1565c0
    {{/if}}
    {{#if enableKerberosAuth}}
    {{#if enableKerberosLB}}
    style LB fill:#fff3e0,color:#e65100,stroke:#ef6c00
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
    {{#if enableVirtualApp}}
    {{#if enableHorizon}}
    style HORIZON_GRP fill:#e8eaf6,color:#000,stroke:#3949ab
    {{/if}}
    {{#if enableCitrix}}
    style CITRIX_GRP fill:#e8eaf6,color:#000,stroke:#3949ab
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
